OL,3,GNEWSAProperties adapting to changing
OL,4,Anature of storms
OL,5,
OL,6,FExtreme weather events including named
OL,7,Fstorms are forcing organisations to
OL,8,Fadapt their sites to protect themselves
OL,9,Fand visitors.
OL,11,FStorms Austen and Boelo wreaked havoc
OL,12,Fand caused disruption across the UK at
OL,13,Fthe end of last week as they brought
OL,14,Fwind gusts of 85mph (137km/h) and heavy
OL,15,Fdownpours of rain.
OL,17,FTrees were uprooted during the storms,
OL,18,Fincluding an incident which led to the
OL,19,Fdeath of 60-year-old Richard Baines in
OL,20,FScotland, along with public transport
OL,21,Fservice cancellations and power cuts to
OL,22,Fthousands of properties.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
