OL,3,GNEWSAProperties adapting to changing
OL,4,Anature of storms
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn south-west England, tourism and
OL,7,Fcouncil bosses said they were having to
OL,8,Fbattle with the "unpredictability" of
OL,9,Fthe weather as the severity of storms
OL,10,Fappears to increase.
